{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB最新靈異驅魔劇《驅魔速遞》首度曝光宣傳片，女主角陳曉華（Hera）的破格造型即時引爆熱議！片中她一改斯文形象，以冷艷型格的黑絲速遞魔女Look登場，更連環施展超強腿功，場面震撼。夥拍同樣打得的戴祖儀，兩位女主角的激鬥畫面，究竟誰更吸睛？\n</p>\n<h2>首度曝光預告 陳曉華黑絲魔女打到飛起</h2>\n<p>在最新曝光的《驅魔速遞》預告片中，最搶眼的莫過於女主角陳曉華的全新形象。她飾演的魔女以一身黑色絲襪速遞員造型現身，冷艷又型格，完全顛覆過往形象。片中她有多場精彩打鬥戲，大晒超強腿功將敵人踢飛，動作流暢有力，型到飛起。劇集以靈異驅魔為主題，包裝在連場打鬥之下，深入探討人性陰暗面，提出「當愛與信念被逼上絕境，人們是否承受得起實現願望的代價？」的詰問，題材相當吸引。</p>\n<h2>戴祖儀魚網High Kick迎戰 雙女主角造型引爆期待</h2>\n<p>除了陳曉華的黑絲造型，劇中另一位女主角戴祖儀的戰鬥格同樣吸睛。她在預告中以「魚網High Kick」造型登場，與陳曉華的風格截然不同，卻同樣充滿視覺衝擊力，兩大女神的對手戲令人期待。劇集由近年備受好評的周嘉洛及吳偉豪擔任男主角，夥拍陳曉華及戴祖儀，新鮮的組合加上充滿張力的靈異題材，已成功引爆觀眾期待值。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版式討論：Hera轉型好正！</h2>\n<p>預告片一出，網民反應極之熱烈，紛紛在討論區洗版留言。大部分網民都對陳曉華的轉型讚不絕口：「Hera終於唔係乖乖女，型到癲！」「黑絲魔女呢個設定好正，TVB終於識玩！」「陳曉華啲腿功好勁，睇到嘩嘩聲！」亦有網民表示對兩位女主角的組合充滿期待：「黑絲 vs 魚網，今次有睇頭！」「戴祖儀個High Kick好屈機！」「周嘉洛配陳曉華好有新鮮感，期待！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_7117980836b011a4a1095d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_7117980836b011a4a1095d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06a_12005624756b011a4d6f554.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06a_12005624756b011a4d6f554.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_230117246b011a50776b5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_230117246b011a50776b5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_9421425576b011a5604ca2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_9421425576b011a5604ca2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_20985380756b011a5a3d10c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_20985380756b011a5a3d10c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_16161440516b011a5fa40a3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_16161440516b011a5fa40a3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_20097936036b011a66653e8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_20097936036b011a66653e8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11a_8876195106b011a6bf243b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11a_8876195106b011a6bf243b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_5410618736b011a7101a4e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_5410618736b011a7101a4e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_18527137446b011a755e586.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_18527137446b011a755e586.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:43:52.468117+00:00","quality":{